  "referenceNumber": "RUS3737",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect that IMO 9904704 (“KONSTANTIN POSIET”) is, has been, or is likely to be involved in an activity whose object or effect is to destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, namely that IMO 9904704 has been, is and is likely to continue to be, involved in carrying liquefied natural gas that originated in Russia from a place in Russia to a third country.  \n \n",
